        },
        {
            "Id": 1050120010,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 1050120,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 10,
            "SpeakerName": "初魅",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "次の移動公演の件だが、準備は滞りなく進んでいるか？",
            "VoiceFileName": "10501200090",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "FacialExpressionMasterId": 100,
                    "BodyMotionMasterId": 3,
                    "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
                    "SpineId": 20101,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 3,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                }
            ],
            "SpeakerIconId": "201"
        },
        {
            "Id": 1050120011,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 1050120,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 11,
            "SpeakerName": "容",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "うん、問題ないよ。/n他の皆もさ、世界演劇リーグの後から火がついたみたいなんだよ。",
            "VoiceFileName": "10501200100",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "SpineId": 0,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 2,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                },
                {
                    "slotNumber": 2,
                    "FacialExpressionMasterId": 200,
                    "BodyMotionMasterId": 20,
                    "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
                    "SpineId": 20401,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 4,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                }
            ],
            "SpeakerIconId": "204"
        },
        {
            "Id": 1050120012,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 1050120,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 12,
            "SpeakerName": "初魅",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "ああ、それは私も、稽古を見ながら常々感じているよ。/n本当に頼もしい……そして逞しいな、我がEdenは。",
            "VoiceFileName": "10501200110",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "FacialExpressionMasterId": 70,
                    "BodyMotionMasterId": 14,
                    "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
                    "SpineId": 0,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 2,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                },
                {
                    "slotNumber": 2,
                    "SpineId": 0,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 4,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                }
            ],
            "SpeakerIconId": "201"
        },
        {
            "Id": 1050120013,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 1050120,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 13,
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "",
            "SeFileName": "40",
            "CharacterMotions": []
        },
        {
            "Id": 1050120014,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 1050120,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 14,
            "SpeakerName": "初魅",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "（ん？　知らない番号からの電話だな……誰だ？）",
            "VoiceFileName": "10501200120",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "FacialExpressionMasterId": 102,
                    "BodyMotionMasterId": 7,
                    "SpineId": 20101,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 3,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                }
            ],
            "SpeakerIconId": "201"
        },
        {
            "Id": 1050120015,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 1050120,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 15,
            "SpeakerName": "審査員Ｋ",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "『突然の連絡、失礼する。/n　ダイスターの祭典で、キミたちの審査を務めていた者だ』",
            "VoiceFileName": "10501200130",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 1050120016,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 1050120,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 16,
            "SpeakerName": "初魅",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "！　ほう……まさかダイスターと呼ばれる名優から、/n直々にお電話を頂けるとは光栄だな。",
            "BackgroundImageFileName": "2252",
            "VoiceFileName": "10501200140",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "201"
        },
        {
            "Id": 1050120017,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 1050120,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 17,
            "SpeakerName": "初魅",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "それで、私になんの用かな？",
            "VoiceFileName": "10501200150",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "201"
        },
        {
            "Id": 1050120018,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 1050120,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 18,
            "SpeakerName": "審査員Ｋ",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "『……単刀直入に言わせてもらう。/n　キミたちEdenに是非とも参加してもらいたい演劇の賞レースがある』",
            "VoiceFileName": "10501200160",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 1050120019,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 1050120,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 19,
            "SpeakerName": "審査員Ｋ",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "『私が審査・運営に参加する大会でね。/n　悪い話ではないと思うが……どうだろうか？』",
            "VoiceFileName": "10501200170",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 1050120020,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 1050120,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 20,
            "SpeakerName": "初魅",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "どうだろうな。/n別に栄誉欲しさに、芝居をやっているわけではないからな。",
            "VoiceFileName": "10501200180",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "201"
        },
        {
            "Id": 1050120021,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 1050120,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 21,
            "SpeakerName": "審査員Ｋ",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "『言い方を変えよう、キミたちに挑戦の機会を与えてやる。/n　……演劇界に、君達の舞台こそ至高だと示す機会を』",
            "VoiceFileName": "10501200190",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 1050120022,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 1050120,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 22,
            "SpeakerName": "審査員Ｋ",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "『それとも、……もう降りたのか？/n　だとすれば、残念だ』",
            "VoiceFileName": "10501200200",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 1050120023,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 1050120,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 23,
            "SpeakerName": "初魅",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "はっ、まさか……いいだろう、乗せられてやる。/nその話、受けたぞ！",
            "VoiceFileName": "10501200210",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "201"
        },
        {
            "Id": 1050120024,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 1050120,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 24,
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "",
            "BackgroundImageFileName": "1840",
            "BackgroundImageFileFadeType": 2,
            "BgmFileName": "205",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "FadeValue1": 0.20000000298023224,
            "FadeValue2": 0.30000001192092896,
            "FadeValue3": 0.20000000298023224
        },
        {
            "Id": 1050120025,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 1050120,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 25,
            "SpeakerName": "銀河座幹部",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "世界演劇リーグではご苦労だったな、ふたりとも。/n千寿は、最も輝いたダイスターに。",
            "VoiceFileName": "10501200220",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 1050120026,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 1050120,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 26,
            "SpeakerName": "銀河座幹部",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "ウォルフの方も、最も輝いた劇団に選ばれなかったとはいえ、/n世界演劇リーグの審査員から、銀河座の舞台は評判だったと聞いている。",
            "VoiceFileName": "10501200230",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 1050120027,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 1050120,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 27,
            "SpeakerName": "暦・ラモーナ",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "ありがとうございます。",
            "VoiceFileName": "10501200240",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "FacialExpressionMasterId": 100,
                    "BodyMotionMasterId": 13,
                    "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
                    "SpineId": 30101,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 2,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                },
                {
                    "slotNumber": 2,
                    "FacialExpressionMasterId": 109,
                    "BodyMotionMasterId": 13,
                    "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
                    "SpineId": 30201,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 4,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                }
            ],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 1050120028,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 1050120,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 28,
            "SpeakerName": "銀河座幹部",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "……さて、前置きはここまでにして本題に入ろう。/n今日ここへふたりを呼んだのは、銀河座の今後について話をする為だ。",
            "VoiceFileName": "10501200250",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 1050120029,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 1050120,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 29,
            "SpeakerName": "銀河座幹部",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "……もう既に知っていると思うが、/n今度、銀河座とは別に、新たな劇団を正式に立ち上げることになった。",
            "VoiceFileName": "10501200260",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 1050120030,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 1050120,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 30,
            "SpeakerName": "銀河座幹部",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "銀河と共に並ぶ、新たな劇団の名は……『星雲』。/nその座長には……ラモーナ・ウォルフを任命する。",
            "VoiceFileName": "10501200270",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 1050120031,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 1050120,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 31,
            "SpeakerName": "ラモーナ",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "……はい！",
            "VoiceFileName": "10501200280",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "FacialExpressionMasterId": 101,
                    "BodyMotionMasterId": 13,
                    "LipSyncMasterId": 3,
                    "SpineId": 30201,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 3,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                }
            ],
            "SpeakerIconId": "302"
        },
        {
            "Id": 1050120032,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 1050120,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 32,
            "SpeakerName": "ラモーナ",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "（覚悟は決めた……あの舞台で見えた世界、/n　私は皆を率いて……銀河で輝く天頂の星となる）",
            "VoiceFileName": "10501200290",
            "CharacterMotions": [
                {
                    "slotNumber": 1,
                    "FacialExpressionMasterId": 109,
                    "BodyMotionMasterId": 15,
                    "SpineId": 30201,
                    "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
                    "CharacterPosition": 3,
                    "CharacterLayerType": 1,
                    "SpineSize": 2
                }
            ],
            "SpeakerIconId": "302"
        },
        {
            "Id": 1050120033,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 1050120,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 33,
            "SpeakerName": "銀河座幹部",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "銀河は千寿暦、星雲はラモーナ・ウォルフ。/nふたりの座長で連携しながら、我が劇団の未来を紡いでくれ。",
            "VoiceFileName": "10501200300",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 1050120034,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 1050120,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 34,
            "SpeakerName": "暦",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "承知いたしました。",
            "BackgroundImageFileName": "2253",
            "VoiceFileName": "10501200310",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "301"
        },
        {
            "Id": 1050120035,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 1050120,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 35,
            "SpeakerName": "ラモーナ",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "ああ。",
            "VoiceFileName": "10501200320",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "302"
        },
        {
            "Id": 1050120036,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 1050120,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 36,
            "SpeakerName": "銀河座幹部",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "……以上だ。",
            "VoiceFileName": "10501200330",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "1"
        },
        {
            "Id": 1050120037,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 1050120,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 37,
            "SpeakerName": "暦",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "（このところ、状況は日々目まぐるしく変わってきている。/n　今までであれば、伝統を重んじてきた銀河座に変化など不要でした）",
            "VoiceFileName": "10501200340",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "301"
        },
        {
            "Id": 1050120038,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 1050120,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 38,
            "SpeakerName": "暦",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "（しかし今は……この変化は、きっと喜ぶべきものでしょう。/n　居場所が生まれ、新たに星が輝く余地が生まれた）",
            "VoiceFileName": "10501200350",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "301"
        },
        {
            "Id": 1050120039,
            "EpisodeMasterId": 1050120,
            "Order": 1,
            "GroupOrder": 39,
            "SpeakerName": "暦",
            "FontSize": 2,
            "Phrase": "（良い意味で銀河は形を変えている……。役者たちの演技と共に、/n　広がり……輝き続ける。時の流れにも、負けることなく）",
            "VoiceFileName": "10501200360",
            "CharacterMotions": [],
            "SpeakerIconId": "301"
        },
